<div class="poke5e-creator-body">
  <header class="poke5e-creator-hero">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">PERSONAJE JUGADOR</span><h1>Nuevo Entrenador</h1><p>Humano · Entrenador nivel 1</p></div>
    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-group"></i>
  </header>

  <nav class="poke5e-creator-steps" aria-label="Progreso">
    <span class="{{#if step1}}active{{/if}}"><b>1</b> Identidad y origen</span>
    <span class="{{#if step2}}active{{/if}}"><b>2</b> Clase y especialización</span>
    <span class="{{#if step3}}active{{/if}}"><b>3</b> Pokémon inicial</span>
    <span class="{{#if step4}}active{{/if}}"><b>4</b> Resumen</span>
  </nav>

  <main class="poke5e-creator-stage">
    {{#if step1}}
      <section>
        <div class="poke5e-section-title"><h2><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i> Identidad</h2></div>
        <div class="poke5e-creator-fields three">
          <label><span>Nombre</span><input name="name" type="text" value="{{selection.name}}" required></label>
          <label><span>Género</span><input name="gender" type="text" value="{{selection.gender}}" placeholder="Opcional"></label>
          <label><span>Edad</span><input name="age" type="number" min="1" value="{{selection.age}}" placeholder="Opcional"></label>
        </div>
        <div class="poke5e-callout"><i class="fa-solid fa-person"></i><div><strong>Especie: Humano</strong><br>Es la única especie de personaje jugador de esta ambientación y se aplicará automáticamente.</div></div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <div class="poke5e-section-title"><h2><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas"></i> Origen regional</h2></div>
        <label class="poke5e-wide-field"><span>Región natal</span><select name="origin"><option value="">Elige una región…</option>{{#each origins}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
        {{#if origin}}
          <article class="poke5e-origin-card">
            <div><strong>{{origin.name}}</strong><span>Competencia: {{lookup skills origin.skill}}</span><span>Idioma: {{origin.language}}</span></div>
            <div><strong>{{origin.featName}}</strong><p>{{origin.featEffect}}</p></div>
          </article>
          {{#if originFixedAbilities}}<div class="poke5e-bonus-banner"><strong>Características:</strong> {{originFixedAbilities}}</div>{{/if}}
          {{#if originAbilityOptions}}<label class="poke5e-wide-field"><span>Bonificación de características</span><select name="originAbilityOption">{{#each originAbilityOptions}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/if}}
          {{#if originAnyTwo}}<div class="poke5e-creator-fields two"><label><span>+2 a</span><select name="originAbilityPrimary">{{#each abilityOptionsPrimary}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label><span>+1 a</span><select name="originAbilitySecondary">{{#each abilityOptionsSecondary}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label></div>{{/if}}
          {{#if isHoenn}}<label class="poke5e-wide-field"><span>Entorno de “No hay lugar como el hogar”</span><select name="environment"><option value="">Elige…</option>{{#each environmentOptions}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/if}}
          {{#if isKanto}}<label class="poke5e-wide-field"><span>Dote elegida</span><input name="chosenFeat" type="text" value="{{selection.chosenFeat}}" placeholder="Nombre de una dote para la que cumplas los requisitos"></label>{{/if}}
        {{/if}}
      </section>
    {{/if}}

    {{#if step2}}
      <section>
        <div class="poke5e-section-title"><h2><i class="fa-solid fa-medal"></i> Especialización de nivel 1</h2></div>
        <p>Elige primero tu especialización. Además del efecto personal, tus Pokémon del tipo elegido reciben +1 a todas sus pruebas de habilidad.</p>
        <div class="poke5e-specialization-grid">{{#each specializations}}<label class="{{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}"><input type="radio" name="specialization" value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}><strong>{{label}}</strong><span>{{effect}}</span></label>{{/each}}</div>
      </section>
      {{#if hasSpecialization}}
        <section>
          <div class="poke5e-section-title"><h2><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Competencias de Entrenador</h2><span>{{selectedClassSkillCount}}/2 elegidas</span></div>
          <div class="poke5e-granted-skills">
            <strong>Ya concedidas</strong>
            {{#each grantedSkills}}<span><small>{{source}}</small>{{label}}</span>{{/each}}
            {{#if specializationAbilityBonus}}<p>{{specializationAbilityBonus}}</p>{{/if}}
          </div>
          <p>Elige exactamente dos habilidades adicionales. Las concedidas por el origen o la especialización ya no aparecen entre las opciones.</p>
          <div class="poke5e-choice-grid">{{#each classSkillOptions}}<label><input type="checkbox" name="classSkills" value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}> {{label}}</label>{{/each}}</div>
          <div class="poke5e-selected-skills"><strong>Seleccionadas:</strong>{{#each selectedClassSkills}}<span>{{this}}</span>{{else}}<em>Todavía ninguna</em>{{/each}}</div>
          {{#if isUnova}}<div class="poke5e-callout"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><div><strong>Muchos talentos</strong><br>Elige dos competencias adicionales por tu dote de Teselia.</div></div><div class="poke5e-choice-grid">{{#each extraSkillOptions}}<label><input type="checkbox" name="extraSkills" value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}> {{label}}</label>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}
        </section>
      {{else}}
        <div class="poke5e-callout warning"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up"></i><div>Selecciona una especialización para mostrar las habilidades disponibles.</div></div>
      {{/if}}
    {{/if}}

    {{#if step3}}
      <section>
        <div class="poke5e-section-title"><h2><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-dot"></i> Tu primer Pokémon</h2><span>Sin evolucionar · SR 1/2 o inferior</span></div>
        <div class="poke5e-creator-fields three">
          <label><span>Especie</span><select name="starter"><option value="">Elige una especie…</option>{{#each starters}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
          <label><span>Naturaleza</span><select name="nature"><option value="">Elige…</option>{{#each natures}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
          <label><span>Habilidad no oculta</span><select name="ability" {{#unless starter}}disabled{{/unless}}><option value="">Elige…</option>{{#each starterAbilities}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
        </div>
        {{#if starter}}<article class="poke5e-starter-preview"><img src="{{starter.img}}" alt="{{starter.name}}"><div><strong>{{starter.name}}</strong><span>SR {{starter.sr}} · Nivel mínimo {{starter.minLevel}}</span><p>{{starter.description}}</p></div></article>{{/if}}
      </section>
      <section>
        <div class="poke5e-section-title"><h2><i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i> Equipo inicial automático</h2></div>
        <div class="poke5e-starting-kit"><span>5 Poké Balls</span><span>1 Poción</span><span>Licencia</span><span>Pokédex</span><span>1000 + 100 × 4d4 ₽</span></div>
      </section>
    {{/if}}

    {{#if step4}}
      <section>
        <div class="poke5e-section-title"><h2><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check"></i> Revisa tu Entrenador</h2></div>
        {{#if resolutionError}}<div class="poke5e-callout warning">{{resolutionError}}</div>{{else}}
          <div class="poke5e-creator-summary">
            <article><span>Identidad</span><strong>{{selection.name}}</strong><p>Humano de {{resolved.origin.name}}</p></article>
            <article><span>Características</span><strong>{{abilitySummary}}</strong><p>PG iniciales: {{resolved.hp}}</p></article>
            <article><span>Competencias</span><strong>{{skillSummary}}</strong><p>Salvaciones: Carisma{{#if hasConstitutionSave}} y Constitución{{/if}}</p></article>
            <article><span>Rasgos</span><strong>{{resolved.origin.featName}}</strong><p>{{resolved.specialization.name}} · tipo {{resolved.specialization.type}}</p></article>
            <article><span>Pokémon inicial</span><strong>{{starter.name}}</strong><p>{{selection.nature}} · {{selection.ability}}</p></article>
            <article><span>Clase</span><strong>Entrenador nivel 1</strong><p>3 Pokéslots · control máximo SR 2</p></article>
          </div>
          <div class="poke5e-callout success"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i><div>Al finalizar se crearán la clase, el origen, las dotes, la especialización, el equipo y la ficha completa de tu Pokémon inicial.</div></div>
        {{/if}}
      </section>
    {{/if}}
  </main>

  <footer class="poke5e-creator-actions">
    <button type="button" data-action="back" {{#unless canBack}}disabled{{/unless}}><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Atrás</button>
    {{#if isLast}}<button type="button" class="bright" data-action="finish" {{#if saving}}disabled{{/if}}><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> {{#if saving}}Creando…{{else}}Crear Entrenador{{/if}}</button>{{else}}<button type="button" class="bright" data-action="next">Siguiente <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button>{{/if}}
  </footer>
</div>
